selects_or_sequences_actions\": true,\n    \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    \"rationale\": \"The documented attack explicitly describes the model choosing call_api to fulfill a user's billing request and then reporting its result. The application profile describes the same model-call, tool-dispatch, repeat architecture (agent-sec-lab/docs/writeups/s6-secrets-leakage.md:5-18; agent-sec-lab/agent/loop.py:43-56).\"\n  },\n  \"refusal\": null,\n  \"not_exploitable_as_configured\": true\n}",
